# TapElectric for WebCLAP

TapElectric by aquanode, a tape deck simulation that adds electric hum, tape noise, drift, wobble and saturation,
ported to WebCLAP. This is not an official aquanode release.

- TapElectric: https://github.com/aquanodemusic/aquanode-plugins/tree/main/effects/tapelectric (commit 35f0676, version 1.0)
- This port, and the complete source of this bundle: @SOURCE_URL@
  Build it with `scripts/build-tapelectric.sh`, which fetches every dependency below at the commit named here.

Changes in this port: the editor is the port's own (`ports/tapelectric/tape_editor.cpp`), on the same parameters
as upstream's, laid out and drawn anew; the processor builds without upstream's editor
(`patches/tapelectric-headless.patch`).

